UNIT TESTING FRAMEWORK (Procedure)
STEP 0 
Prerequisites
We need to have the following before proceeding with unit testing:
•	VS Code installed
•	Python installed (3.10+ recommended)
•	Snowflake account access as “accountadmin”
•	Snowflake username, password, and account name with location
•	Database and schema access
•	At least one test table in Snowflake (bronze_customers_delta and silver_customers_delta in our case and similar for orders and products table)
