Create Project Structure
•	Create a folder in your local machine: “snowflake_ut_framework”
•	Open or select this folder in VS Code.
•	Create this folder structure in VS Code:
snowflake_ut_framework/
│
├── config/
├── input/
├── engine/
├── reports/
├── logs/
