import yaml

def read_config(config_path):

    with open(config_path, "r") as file:
        config = yaml.safe_load(file)

    return config

•	In this code when Python sees: with open(config_path, "r")
it opens: framework_config.yaml
•	Then: yaml.safe_load() converts:
environment: DEV into:
{
   "environment": "DEV"
}
           Python can now use it.
